 <h3><u>BAAP</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Din dhale jab karke mazdoori Raza aata hai Baap..(2)<br> Dekh kar hanste hue bachon ko sukh pata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Samne Ankhon k jis bete ke mar jata hai baap<br> Lamha lamha zindagi bhar usko yaad ata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Jane kitne khwab karte hain safar bache ke sath<br> Ghar se pehli bar jab school le jata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Umar bhar rehti hai us bete ke dil me ik khalish<br> Jab tarakki dekhne se pehle mar jata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Thaam kar ungli jise chalna sikhaya muddaton<br> Ek din uske sahare ko taras jata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Jab numaya kamiyabi chume bete ke qadam<br> Nazr dilwati hai maa, sajde me gir jata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Zindagi bhar chalta rehta hai mashinon ki tarah<br> Maut ki godi me ek din thak k sojata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Rote rote bus yahi kehta hai wo haye Hussain<br> Jab kabhi apne jawan bete ko dafnata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Koi un bachon se puche kya hai shadi ka maza<br> Byaah ki tareekh rakh kar jinki mar jata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Roz e ashura bana deti hai maa saqqa hume<br> Ek chota sa uthane ko Alam lata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Roke zainab s.a ne kaha baba bhara ghar lut gaya<br> Jab shabe sham e garibaan me nazar aata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Kya kahunga haal e Asghar poch bethe jo rubab<br> Agey jata hai kbhi peeche palat aata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Mangne aati hai jab darbaar me baag e fidak<br> Ghamzada beti ko jane kitna yad ata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Hone hi wali hai is sham e garibaan ki sehar<br> Bazuon ko choom kar beti ko samjhata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Qaid khane me hua kohraam bacchi mar gai<br> Khuwab me ek shab sakeena ko nazar aata hai baap</p> 
  <p>Ye azadari ka sadqa hai jo barzakh me Raza<br> Majlison me rote hain hum or jaza pata hai baap..</p> 
